{"id":"n78324-1-7","stage":4,"title":"참신하다 · 崭新 ","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78324-1-7-1","ko":"새로 산 가방이 마음에 드니?","zh":"新买的包你喜欢吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가방이","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음에","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드니?","meaning":"中意，称心，看中","explanation":"들다：中意，称心，看中；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"11","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"中意，称心，看中","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"觉得某物好。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f4d28ee567391274ec7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78324-1-7-2","ko":"응. 가격은 좀 비싸지만 디자인이 참신해서 좋아.","zh":"嗯。虽然价格有点贵，但设计很新颖，所以很喜欢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가격은","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비싸지만","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"디자인이","meaning":"设计","explanation":"디자인：设计；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"디자인","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54448","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참신해서","meaning":"崭新 ，新颖","explanation":"참신하다：崭新 ，新颖；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"참신하다","audio":"/audio/32e672dd759164d4f035.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78324","senseId":"1","lemma":"참신하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"ter